{
  "version": 1,
  "notes": "Ontology layer over skills.json. 'groups' maps each taxonomy category to one of the ten top-level groups (with per-skill overrides). 'related' lists technologies that are alternatives to each other: having one is reported as related experience but NEVER counted as having another. 'implies' lists conservative implications (e.g. PostgreSQL implies SQL); they are reported as 'inferred (unverified)' with low strength, never as demonstrated.",
